    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.direction.amara.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.eve.amara.asset.sprite.amara",
        "actorId": "amara",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭を、アマラと回ることになった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "回り始めて三分で、石畳に白いチョークの線が引かれた。「開廷します」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……祭りの真ん中で、路上法廷だ。この人のデートは、だいたい裁判になる。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本日の被告は「明日の決勝の緊張」原告は、私。傍聴席は、りんご飴を持った通行人の皆さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "裁判長のチョークが、慣れた手つきで証言台の四角を描いた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「証人ミミさん。明日の相手を、一言で」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……台帳が選び抜いた、四百年ぶんの全盛期。「怖いですか」耳が、正直に、へなっと倒れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……はい。正直に言うと、傍聴席から「わかるよ」と声が飛んだ。良い法廷だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラは、重々しく頷いて、チョークで大きく書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「証拠一。この人は、怖くても出る」証拠二、九つの封蝋。証拠三、赤線五本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……私の一年が、石畳の上に、証拠品として並んでいく。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「では、判決」傍聴席が、静まった。アマラはチョークを置いて、初めて裁判長の顔をやめた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「——判決は、出しません。続きが見たいので」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は昔、裁く側として、たくさんの終わりを言い渡してきた人だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その人が、終わりを言い渡さない練習をしている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさんの明日は、判決より、続きのほうが面白いから」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉廷の代わりに、二人でチョークの線を消して回った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "消しながら、アマラが小声で言う。「一つだけ、先に言い渡しておきます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「明日、何が起きても——両者勝訴。あなたと、あなたの一年に」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、手のひらに、チョークの粉が残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.amara.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白い粉を、払わずに帰った。今夜の判決文の、かけらだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.amara.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
